<<<
ground of adultery, whilst thousands of innocent sufferers under desertion, drink, cruelty, & insanity, are left outside any relief. He is plainly . Stating what he takes to be the existing position;
===
*ground of adultery, whilst thousands of innocent sufferers under desertion, drink, cruelty, & insanity, are left outside any relief.* He is plainly stating what he takes to be the existing position;
>>>

<<<
how can that be unthinkable? read flagrant injuslice./He said we were apt to forget the lessons of the war; some people he met said ‘I want to forget’; that was, to his mind, a wrong & unthinkable attitude to adopt. Unthinking?
